<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθέω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θεύσομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a secret attack,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ ἐχθρόν . . λύκοιο δίκαν
					ὑποθεύσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.84
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut in before,</i> in running a race, <i>supplant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1161
			</span></i>; of a solar eclipse, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλείπει . . τῆς σελήνης ὑποθεούσης
					αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cleom.
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ σελήνη ὑποθεύσεται τὸν ἥλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					26.317b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of dogs,
				<i>run in too hastily,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>